/target

# Per-machine Claude Code state, not project configuration.
#
# This dev environment creates zero-byte, read-only placeholders at these
# paths — and `skills`, `hooks`, `workflows`, `routines` and `output-styles`
# are placeholder *files* where a working setup expects *directories*, so
# committing them would plant a file in a clone where a teammate's tooling
# needs to create a directory. Anything here that is genuinely shared config
# should be un-ignored deliberately, one path at a time.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.local.json
.mcp.json
